  "statement": {
    "representation": "markdown-latex",
    "text": "Given $k >$ 0, is there a closed, simply connected, smooth 4manifold X and a nonzero homotopy class $\\alpha \\in \\pi_{k}(Diff_{\\partial}(X^{\\circ}))$ such that $\\alpha \\in \\ker(i_{*}: \\pi_{k}(Diff_{\\partial}(X^{\\circ})) \\to \\pi_{k}(Homeo_{\\partial}(X^{\\circ})))$ (14) and $\\alpha \\notin \\ker(s_{*}: \\pi_{k}(Diff_{\\partial}(X^{\\circ})) \\to \\pi_{k}(Diff_{\\partial}(X^{\\circ}\\#S^{2} \\times S^{2})))$? (15)",
